  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dt>Description</dt>\n<dd>This template is a shorthand for <code>&lt;div style=\"clear:both;\"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</code>.</dd>\n<dd>It moves any content following the template below any objects floating to the left and/or right (TOCs, infoboxes, images, etc..).</dd>\n<dt>Syntax</dt>\n<dd>Type <code>{{<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Clr\" title=\"Template:Clr\">clr</a>}}</code> in an article at the point you want the clear.</dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205357\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 173/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 95/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 66/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 6/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    4.772      1 Template:T\n100.00%    4.772      1 -total\n 41.03%    1.958     20 Template:T/piece\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:55-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205357 and revision id 55. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
